WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:00.533
Well, it's been

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:01.267
a year since

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.035
Russian tanks

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:02.802
rolled across

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.870
Ukrainian borders,

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.405
triggering a war that killed

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.873
thousands of civilians,

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.475
forced millions to flee

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.710
and upended countless lives.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.779
Tensions are high and extra

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.280
security measures are in place

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.582
in cities and towns

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:16.616
throughout Ukraine

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:17.717
as the country braces

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.953
for potential Russian attacks.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.688
World leaders, meanwhile,

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.156
are expressing their solidarity

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:23.957
with Kiev.

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:25.492
The Polish prime minister

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:26.626
met with his counterpart

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.062
in the capital city to mark the occasion.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.630
And the Ukrainian president

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.598
visited a hospital

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.266
there and awarded medals

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.101
to injured soldiers.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.803
Earlier in an emotional address

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:37.670
to his troops.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.873
A lot of Maslansky promised victory

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:42.709
in 2023

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:45.812
With us it is you

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.646
who will decide

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:49.682
whether we are all going to exist,

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.352
whether Ukraine is going to exist

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.387
every day. Every hour.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:55.922
It is you.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.458
Ukrainian soldiers which will decide it.

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:00.660
CNN's chief

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.062
international anchor Christiane

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.931
Amanpour joins me live in Kyiv.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:08.068
Much nervousness as understand it

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.235
this morning

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.137
as to what might unfold in Ukraine.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:14.374
But what's the mood like now, Christiane?

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:16.943
Well, Max, if you can imagine exactly.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:17.610
Exactly.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.278
A year ago

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.613
this time, this capital was under attack.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.882
Surroundings were under attack.

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:23.683
Tank columns

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:25.251
were heading towards this capital

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.686
from the north.

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:27.620
Russia had landed

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.622
paratroopers at an airport nearby

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:30.457
this capital.

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:32.859
The idea was to take this capital

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.527
and decapitate the leadership.

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:35.261
But as you can see,

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:36.229
President Zelensky

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.264
and his army are still standing.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:39.432
And he paid tribute

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.067
to those very soldiers

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.669
who have been maintaining

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.971
the resistance, defending and creating

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:46.206
counter offensives

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:47.674
over this past year

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:49.342
and also to the civilians

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:50.043
who have,

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:50.810
by and large,

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.946
all turned into overnight soldiers

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.949
all resisting this invasion by Russia,

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:56.449
which, yes,

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.052
it is its first full scale year,

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:00.086
but it's been going on

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.688
in the east since 2014.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:03.857
So this country has been suffering

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:06.559
and suffering significant losses.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.095
15,000 before this war started

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.263
this this current one.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.231
And now who knows

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:12.866
tens of thousands of dead

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:15.835
and wounded in support of this country.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.670
However they remain

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.372
by and large optimistic

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:21.508
that with the support of their allies

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:23.176
who you just saw in vigils

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:25.378
and moments of remembrance

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:27.313
in Europe and other capitals,

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.215
they remain optimistic here

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.017
that with that continued support

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:33.887
their resistance will continue as well.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:34.954
Max,

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.891
we saw Western leaders speaking today

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:42.295
showing, you know, unity behind Ukraine,

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:43.363
also suggesting

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:46.065
that NATO's be stronger than it is

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:46.933
right now.

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.401
How would you rate the

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:50.003
state of the Western alliance

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:53.339
Well, again, and just to say

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.307
that as yet

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.342
today, there has been no full

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:58.511
frontal Russian attack on these cities.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:00.513
So let's just keep our fingers crossed.

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:02.315
It's a very different situation

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:04.417
than it was exactly a year ago.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:06.219
But over the last months,

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:08.054
you know that the Russians have been

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.355
using their missiles

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.557
and their offensives

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:11.824
against civilian targets,

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:13.259
including infrastructure.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:13.860
All of that

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:14.627
to say

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:15.628
that the Ukrainians

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:16.663
have been expending

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:18.765
a huge amount of the weaponry

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:19.766
they've been receiving

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:20.833
and of the ammunition

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:21.801
they've been receiving.

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:23.403
And that needs to be stepped up.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.104
According to all the NATO's leaders,

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:26.272
they need to get

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.374
much more ammunition here

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:29.642
for the weapons systems

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:30.944
that have already been delivered.

00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:32.979
Very importantly and symbolically,

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.080
when you mentioned

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.014
and you showed the Polish

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.449
prime minister coming here,

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:39.219
he did come with the first of the Polish

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:41.187
leopard tanks, their German tanks,

00:03:41.187 --> 00:03:43.223
but they've been released by Germany

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:44.824
from third party countries

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:45.858
to send them here.

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:46.826
And so symbolically,

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:48.094
the first has arrived.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:49.596
But, of course, the question now

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:51.698
remains from President Zelensky,

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:53.499
who says that last year

00:03:53.499 --> 00:03:55.268
our watchword was weapons.

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.537
This year it is speed, speed, speed.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.072
We do not have time to waste

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.807
every single moment we waste

00:04:00.807 --> 00:04:02.041
are more lives lost.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:02.976
He's framed

00:04:02.976 --> 00:04:04.644
this as a battle between David

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:05.411
and Goliath,

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:06.813
and David needs all the help

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:07.580
it can get

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.450
to have a knockout punch in his sling.

00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:11.384
And so that is

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:14.254
what the message is for this second year

00:04:14.621 --> 00:04:15.221
of war.

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:17.423
CNN's Christiane Amanpour

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:18.758
live for us in Kiev

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:20.560
on this one year anniversary.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:21.227
Thank you so much.

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:22.362
The Ukrainian military

00:04:22.362 --> 00:04:23.763
calling the anniversary a day

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.331
that has become

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:27.100
symbolic for the whole world.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.468
And Kiev is preparing for

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:29.802
what could be another massive round

00:04:29.802 --> 00:04:30.570
of Russian strikes.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.572
To mark the occasion, as we were saying.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:34.207
Meanwhile, a grinding war

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:36.342
of attrition continues, playing it out,

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:39.112
playing out along the eastern front lines

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:40.213
and Russian mercenaries

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:40.446
are now

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.282
claiming control of a village

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:44.250
near the embattled city of backwoods,

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.184
an area

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:47.487
where some of the fiercest fighting

00:04:47.487 --> 00:04:49.756
has been taking place in his small car.

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:51.024
Joins me now

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:53.159
live and die Dnipro in eastern Ukraine.

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:55.094
What is the state of the front lines

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:56.829
right now? Alex

00:04:58.031 --> 00:05:00.099
Max, as you say, it is grinding.

00:05:00.099 --> 00:05:01.167
The fight in the east

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:03.069
and in the south is very active,

00:05:03.069 --> 00:05:04.037
but those front lines

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:05.171
are relatively stagnant.

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:07.540
They haven't changed much since November.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.275
When Ukrainians recaptured

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.977
the city of Harrison that had been held

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:11.678
by the Russians.

00:05:11.678 --> 00:05:13.279
The fiercest fighting

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:14.881
recently has been in the past

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:15.581
few weeks and months

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:17.116
around that city of mood

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:18.584
where Ukrainian forces

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:19.419
have been facing up

00:05:19.419 --> 00:05:21.688
against largely those mercenaries

00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:23.556
and convicts from from the Volga Group.

00:05:23.556 --> 00:05:24.957
There have been enormous losses

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:26.959
on both sides, incremental gains

00:05:27.427 --> 00:05:30.129
by the Russian side, including today.

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:31.331
They claim

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:32.231
we can't verify it,

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:32.732
but they claim

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:33.599
that they have taken

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:35.501
a suburb of Back Mount

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:37.303
to the northwest of the city.

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:39.238
We spent yesterday in the dark

00:05:39.238 --> 00:05:40.340
to the south

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:40.907
where Russians

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:42.475
have been trying to push forward.

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:44.610
That would be a key launching off point

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:48.014
for them to move deeper in into Donbas.

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:48.948
We know that the Russians

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:50.650
are trying to mount an offensive.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:51.451
They have been

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:53.052
pushing forward in several areas,

00:05:53.052 --> 00:05:54.253
including voiture

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:57.256
and back mud without much exists success.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.424
Of course, Max,

00:05:58.424 --> 00:06:00.126
the violence is not limited

00:06:00.126 --> 00:06:01.294
to those front lines.

00:06:01.294 --> 00:06:03.329
We have seen missile attacks,

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:05.131
drone attacks all across the country,

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:06.432
including here in the city.

00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:09.402
Of De Dnipro over the past few weeks.

00:06:09.402 --> 00:06:11.637
So the fighting does continue

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:13.773
very actively along those fronts.

00:06:14.374 --> 00:06:15.241
The attacks

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:16.876
do continue in cities and towns

00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:19.345
all across the country from the air.

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:20.847
And then, Max, in the coming weeks,

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:22.982
we are expecting the Ukrainians

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:23.583
to mount

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:24.984
their own counteroffensive,

00:06:24.984 --> 00:06:26.018
to go on the attack

00:06:26.018 --> 00:06:27.987
to try to claw back territory

00:06:27.987 --> 00:06:30.656
from the Russians relatively soon Max.

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:31.491
Well, in the face

00:06:31.491 --> 00:06:33.025
of growing international pressure

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:34.427
over its relationship with Moscow,

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:35.495
China

00:06:35.495 --> 00:06:36.829
is making new calls

00:06:36.829 --> 00:06:38.364
for a political settlement

00:06:38.364 --> 00:06:39.999
to the Ukraine conflict

00:06:39.999 --> 00:06:41.300
following a visit by Beijing's

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.935
top diplomat to the Kremlin.

00:06:42.935 --> 00:06:43.669
China's foreign

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:45.304
ministry has said it's

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:47.106
willing to play a constructive role

00:06:47.106 --> 00:06:49.142
in helping resolve issues, but provided

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:50.810
no details.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:51.944
European leaders are urging

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:53.246
a sense of caution.

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:54.180
European Commission

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.648
President Ursula von der Leyen

00:06:55.648 --> 00:06:57.116
who we heard from earlier, said

00:06:57.116 --> 00:06:58.751
China's proposal needs to be looked

00:06:58.751 --> 00:07:00.720
at in the context of its relationship

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.554
with Russia.

00:07:01.554 --> 00:07:03.256
While Germany says

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:04.190
Beijing

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.959
should talk to both Moscow and Kiev.

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:09.128
Nic Robertson has been busy

00:07:09.128 --> 00:07:10.930
trying to make sense of all of this.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:11.597
Interesting here

00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:13.566
what Fred was saying there about,

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:13.833
you know,

00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:16.068
where Russia goes from here

00:07:16.068 --> 00:07:17.703
in terms of resources.

00:07:17.703 --> 00:07:19.172
I mean, there is talk about China

00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:21.340
providing military resources to Russia.

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:23.109
We heard the head of NATO's

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:24.444
saying that there's intelligence

00:07:24.444 --> 00:07:25.878
to suggest that might happen.

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:26.879
And the United States

00:07:26.879 --> 00:07:28.347
has been saying the same thing.

00:07:28.347 --> 00:07:29.215
It was interesting

00:07:29.215 --> 00:07:31.584
that the Ukrainians said to China's

00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:33.186
12 point

00:07:33.186 --> 00:07:34.921
proposition, which isn't a peace plan,

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:37.023
but it's its 12 aspirations,

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.992
which was a positive response,

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:43.062
which was let's hear more about it.

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:45.698
I think Ukraine is in the business

00:07:45.698 --> 00:07:48.968
of not turning down opportunities

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:49.969
for peace,

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:52.538
but they have to be on Ukraine's terms.

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:53.940
And there's nothing about that

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:54.540
in the language

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.142
that the Chinese have used so far.

00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:57.710
And it's interesting what the US

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:58.377
Secretary of State,

00:07:58.377 --> 00:07:59.145
Antony Blinken,

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:00.980
had to say today about the Chinese

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.248
proposal, which was,

00:08:03.483 --> 00:08:05.451
you know, this is

00:08:05.451 --> 00:08:06.719
okay, we

00:08:06.719 --> 00:08:07.386
see this,

00:08:07.386 --> 00:08:09.789
but it doesn't really have much on it.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:11.557
He said, look,

00:08:11.557 --> 00:08:13.226
China appears to be sort of

00:08:13.226 --> 00:08:16.262
putting a public face of neutrality, but

00:08:16.262 --> 00:08:18.531
actually they're not neutral in this,

00:08:18.531 --> 00:08:19.465
their plight.

00:08:19.465 --> 00:08:21.734
They're giving non-lethal assistance

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:22.602
to Russia.

00:08:22.602 --> 00:08:24.203
They're an important outlet

00:08:24.203 --> 00:08:25.371
for Russian goods,

00:08:25.371 --> 00:08:27.940
specifically energy products.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.442
And the biggest country

00:08:29.442 --> 00:08:31.377
that's behind Russia at the moment.

00:08:31.377 --> 00:08:32.678
And there's the possibility

00:08:32.678 --> 00:08:35.181
that they may provide that lethal aid.

00:08:35.214 --> 00:08:37.149
So I think what we're seeing around

00:08:37.149 --> 00:08:38.150
the China

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:40.520
12 points is a healthy dose

00:08:40.753 --> 00:08:42.188
of skepticism, but saying,

00:08:42.188 --> 00:08:44.056
okay, if you've got something

00:08:44.056 --> 00:08:45.424
let's move forward with it.

00:08:45.424 --> 00:08:47.827
But it's got to be

00:08:47.827 --> 00:08:50.162
achieving what both countries want.

00:08:50.162 --> 00:08:51.831
And there's nothing in there

00:08:51.831 --> 00:08:54.300
about Russia's illegal invasion.

00:08:55.167 --> 00:08:56.869
There's no language around an invasion

00:08:56.869 --> 00:08:57.570
which has offended

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:59.105
many people in the West.

00:08:59.105 --> 00:09:01.140
It has. I mean, it's very clear.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.074
China's position

00:09:02.074 --> 00:09:03.876
here is a pro-Russian position

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:05.244
It's being talked about in

00:09:05.244 --> 00:09:06.546
diplomatic terms today.

00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:07.280
But that was very clear.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:07.847
It was very clear

00:09:07.847 --> 00:09:08.848
when Wang Yi, the chief

00:09:08.848 --> 00:09:10.349
foreign policy adviser to President

00:09:10.349 --> 00:09:11.350
Xi, spoke at the weekend.

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:12.318
He said, you know,

00:09:13.753 --> 00:09:14.754
genuine

00:09:14.754 --> 00:09:17.790
security issues must be addressed.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:20.159
He was speaking about Russia's

00:09:20.159 --> 00:09:20.993
security issues.

00:09:20.993 --> 00:09:21.928
This is what Secretary of State

00:09:21.928 --> 00:09:23.763
Antony Blinken says, that Russia

00:09:23.763 --> 00:09:24.564
that China, rather,

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:26.365
is buying President Putin's

00:09:26.365 --> 00:09:28.467
narrative about the reason for the war.

00:09:28.668 --> 00:09:29.835
Hook, line and sinker.

00:09:29.835 --> 00:09:31.270
He's not challenging it.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.071
And of course

00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:33.272
everyone else is

00:09:33.272 --> 00:09:35.041
because they see it for what it is

00:09:35.041 --> 00:09:36.709
not an accurate reflection

00:09:36.709 --> 00:09:37.443
of what's happened.

00:09:37.443 --> 00:09:38.344
Okay. Thank you, Nick.

